                                           Jean-Marc Valin, Timothy B. Terriberry,
                                           CSIRO, Gregory Maxwell, Mark Borgerding,
                                           Erik de Castro Lopo, Mozilla, Amazon
  speexdsp                  BSD-3-Clause   Xiph.org Foundation, Jean-Marc Valin,
                                           Analog Devices Inc., CSIRO, David Rowe,
                                           EpicGames, Jutta Degener, Carsten Bormann
  rnnoise                   BSD-3-Clause   Jean-Marc Valin, Amazon, Mozilla,
                                           Xiph.Org Foundation, Mark Borgerding
  webrtc-audio-processing   BSD-3-Clause   Google Inc., The WebRTC project authors
                                           (with vendored pffft, Ooura FFT,
                                           spl_sqrt_floor and RNNoise VAD weights)
  abseil-cpp                Apache-2.0     The Abseil Authors (Google Inc.)

libraries/humla/src/main/cpp/rnnoise/model/ holds the RNNoise model data
(rnnoise_data.h, rnnoise_data_init.c, weights_blob.bin), copied from the RNNoise
model release and covered by RNNoise's BSD-3-Clause license.

libraries/humla-protocol/src/Mumble.proto and MumbleUDP.proto are the Mumble
protocol definitions, Copyright The Mumble Developers, under Mumble's BSD-style
license (see the header of each file).

